<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Chennai to Pune | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transport from Chennai to Pune typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 1,189 km via NH 16 usually takes 28‑32 hours of driving time. Our dedicated enclosed carrier adds scheduled rest stops, real‑time GPS monitoring, and a single‑day delivery guarantee for most bookings, ensuring your vehicle reaches Pune promptly and safely.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the packers and movers chennai to pune service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI, covering accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. The policy is automatically activated for every shipment, and you receive a detailed insurance certificate along with the GST‑compliant invoice for full claim transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees in the packers and movers charges from Chennai to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are applied. Our cost breakdown clearly lists base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any optional services you select. All taxes, GST, and e‑Way bill charges are included in the final quote, so the amount you see is the amount you pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for RTO and statutory compliance?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate, valid insurance policy, a copy of your driving licence, PAN card for GST invoicing, and a signed loading inspection sheet. Our team assists in preparing the e‑Way bill and ensures all paperwork meets Maharashtra and Tamil Nadu transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my car from scratches?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp gently aligns the vehicle with the carrier floor, eliminating manual lifting. Combined with edge‑padding and a 4‑wheel lock, the car is secured without contact to the trailer walls. This method, verified during joint inspection, guarantees a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Chennai‑to‑Pune move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link and can monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations instantly from any device.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes your service the best packers and movers from Chennai to Pune compared to competitors?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet of 120+ specialized enclosed carriers, ISO‑9001:2015 quality management, IBA‑approved mover code, and 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging set us apart. Coupled with transparent pricing, full insurance, and a zero‑scratch guarantee, we consistently achieve a 4.9/5 Google rating, reflecting unmatched reliability.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
